{"thread":{"threadID":3948,"boardID":117,"topic":"DREAM Adventskalender","time":1480526556,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","lastPostTime":1480616954,"lastPoster":"aPex.","replies":12,"views":622,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":5},"tags":[{"tagID":981,"name":"advent"},{"tagID":983,"name":"adventskalender"},{"tagID":281,"name":"Community"},{"tagID":207,"name":"csgo"},{"tagID":984,"name":"deutsch"},{"tagID":980,"name":"geschenke"},{"tagID":28,"name":"jail"},{"tagID":982,"name":"kalender"}],"posts":[{"postID":53270,"threadID":3948,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"DREAM Adventskalender","time":1480526556,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":5,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2151,"username":"Saitama","time":1480528688,"value":1},{"userID":1153,"username":"Schockly","time":1480533950,"value":1},{"userID":2185,"username":"Ibo107","time":1480537899,"value":1},{"userID":2039,"username":"Wario","time":1480607750,"value":1},{"userID":2389,"username":"DeMo","time":1480608148,"value":1},{"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","time":1480609064,"value":1},{"userID":1563,"username":"aPex.","time":1480616915,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hallöchen,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>wie ihr vielleicht gesehen habt, haben wir für in Kollaboration mit dem Weinhachtsmann für euch einen Adventskalender zusammengestellt.<br>Diesen findet in der Leiste oben oder alternativ hier:</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<div class=\"message-align\"><p><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?advent-calendar/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p></div><p><br>Wir haben dem Weihnachtsmann versprochen, euch nicht zu verraten, was hinter den Türchen versteckt ist, dass heißt aber nicht, dass ihr nicht in diesem Thread raten dürft  <span class=\"missing-media\">[;)]</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Im Adventskalender erwarten euch <strong>täglich Überraschungen </strong>und <strong>Geschenke</strong>, also schaut immer regelmäßig und fleißig vorbei  <span class=\"missing-media\">[^^]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":53271,"threadID":3948,"userID":2151,"username":"Saitama","subject":"","time":1480528700,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>nicuuuuuuuuuuu</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":53272,"threadID":3948,"userID":8,"username":"laduck","subject":"","time":1480528868,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1791,"username":"Pixel","time":1480803534,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Cool</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":53274,"threadID":3948,"userID":1153,"username":"Schockly","subject":"","time":1480530760,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>ok die Musik ist extra laut gemacht worden oder? <span class=\"missing-media\">[^^]</span> Aber schöne Idee <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":53276,"threadID":3948,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1480531126,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>Schockly</strong></cite><p>ok die Musik ist extra laut gemacht worden oder? <span class=\"missing-media\">[^^]</span> Aber schöne Idee <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span><br></p></blockquote><p>War vom Weihnachtsmann so gewollt. Er meinte, wenn die Musik nicht so laut ist, gibt&#x27;s auch keinen Adventskalender!  <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😕</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":53277,"threadID":3948,"userID":1153,"username":"Schockly","subject":"","time":1480531426,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","time":1480533694,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Aso das ist dann natürlich Gesetz! Tut mir leid das ich es gesagt habe lieber Weihnachtsmann</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":53278,"threadID":3948,"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","subject":"","time":1480531449,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Bestimmt Credits und Stammpunkte, freue mich auf beides.<br>#integrierterkanake</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":53279,"threadID":3948,"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","subject":"","time":1480531895,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","time":1480531949,"value":1},{"userID":2223,"username":"NekoCedx3","time":1480534124,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich erwarte Schokolade, die mir nachhause geschickt wird.<br>Falls dies nicht der Fall sein sollte, bin ich zu tiefst enttäuscht!  <span class=\"missing-media\">[;(]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":53286,"threadID":3948,"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","subject":"","time":1480535233,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":4,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2151,"username":"Saitama","time":1480537155,"value":1},{"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","time":1480537207,"value":1},{"userID":2165,"username":"Makaveli1967","time":1480537503,"value":1},{"userID":1791,"username":"Pixel","time":1480803589,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich erwarte für jeden der das 24. Türchen öffnet einen exklusiven Weihnachtsskin oder Maske oder Pet auf den CS:GO Servern, damit würden wir auch Leute ins Forum bekommen!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Allerdings müsste man dann seinen Steam-Account mit dem Forum verbinden oder aber man muss seine Steam-ID eingeben können damit er in der Datenbank hinzugefügt wird.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Oder nen Trail... oder irgendwas aus dem Shop... nur für uns tolle aktive Community-Forum Mitglieder.<br>Weil wir so toll sind... mit wir meine ich uns, also euch... also... wie ihr merkt bin ich schon ganz aufgeregt  <span class=\"archive-emoji\">❤️</span>  <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🤦</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>EDIT: Die doofen nicht Forumnutzer und Plebs sollten dabei natürlich leer ausgehen, ich erwarte was ganz ecklusives...</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Werde dafür natürlich auch meine Beziehungen zu etlichen Wichteln und Elfen spielen lassen  <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😇</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":53289,"threadID":3948,"userID":2223,"username":"NekoCedx3","subject":"","time":1480535646,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","time":1480537176,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich stimme Wickedy zu , jedoch sollte der Liebe bis zum 25.12 vom Forum gebannt sein <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😏</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":53347,"threadID":3948,"userID":2338,"username":"[eXo]","subject":"","time":1480607739,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ist richtig nice und beim 24. Wünsch ich mir 10000 Stammpunkte :D.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":53348,"threadID":3948,"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","subject":"","time":1480607990,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":4,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2165,"username":"Makaveli1967","time":1480608228,"value":1},{"userID":2338,"username":"[eXo]","time":1480608807,"value":1},{"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","time":1480608886,"value":1},{"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","time":1480620251,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>[eXo]</strong></cite><p>Ist richtig nice und beim 24. Wünsch ich mir 10000 Stammpunkte :D.<br></p></blockquote><p>Ich denke mal, dass wird auch immer ein Wunsch bleiben <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😛</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":53366,"threadID":3948,"userID":1563,"username":"aPex.","subject":"","time":1480616954,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","time":1480683920,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Bei mir Stand das ich Krass bin aber Mert sagt der lügt!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Sorry aber doofer Kalender!  <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😏</span></p>","polls":[]}]}